# T_SCRE: Items > Maintenance, the recent service list (newest first,
# more than a page): a record shown, the Record menu's Open item showing
# its item and Esc coming back to the record; the oldest record's notes
# shown read-only; the record edited (Open item there does nothing) and
# saved, then deleted after asking.
S RECENT
K ENTER
S VIEW
K ALT-C I
S ITEM
K ESC
S BACKREC
K ESC END
S LAST
K ENTER PGDN F4
S MEMOVIEW
K ESC CTRL-E ALT-C I
S EDIT
K PGUP DOWN DOWN CTRL-Y
T Recapped the PSU
S EDITSUM
K CTRL-S
S SAVED
K DEL
S DELQ
T Y
S DELETED
K ESC
